Subject: [PATCH 37/58] fix(gui): maximise fills the screen (issue #1)

The window had MaxWidth/MaxHeight 1680x1008, so Windows capped the maximised
window at that size and only moved it to the top-left corner. Drop the cap and
shrink the startup window to 90% of a smaller screen instead.
---
